    "text": "Stuck on a textbook page? Do not just stare at it. Show AI the page, and ask it to explain the idea simply. The trick is context. A photo, your exact doubt, and your class level gives AI a much better starting point. Then ask for steps: explain simply, give an example, and ask me a question. But do not copy answers. Use AI for hints, quizzes, and checking your work. Best setup: AI helps, you practice, and your teacher or textbook verifies."
